{"id": "21-1263-2-10", "zh": "勇士：sūra、vīra、vikkanta；同伴：sahāya、anucara，二者同义；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1264-2-9", "zh": "sannaddha（披甲者）等词通用三性；路粮：pātheyya、sambala。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1266-2-10", "zh": "军队：vāhinī、dhajinī、senā、camū、cakka，还有 bala；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1267-2-6", "zh": "anīka 也是军队的意思。另外，军队的布阵（vinyāsa），", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1268-2-5", "zh": "称为 byūha（阵势）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1270-2-6", "zh": "一头象配十二人，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1271-2-6", "zh": "一匹马配三人，一辆战车", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1272-2-7", "zh": "配四人——按这个标准，这是最低的配置。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1274-2-8", "zh": "象军、马军、车军各由三象、三马、三车组成；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1275-2-8", "zh": "象等都要配备持兵器的人；持兵器的四个人组成步军（pattānīka）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1277-2-7", "zh": "当六十束竹子、每束各有六十根竹竿，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1278-2-15", "zh": "都被行进中的军队扬起的尘土蒙住时，这支军队称为 akkhobhiṇī（阴性）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1280-2-9", "zh": "兴盛：sampatti、sampadā、lakkhī、sirī；灾厄：vipatti、āpadā；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1281-2-15", "zh": "武器：āvudha、heti（阴性）、sattha、paharaṇa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1283-2-8", "zh": "既放出又不放出的、不放出的、从手中放出的，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1284-2-8", "zh": "以及由器械放出的——武器总共就是这四种。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1286-2-8", "zh": "既放出又不放出的，如棍棒等；不放出的，如小刀等；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1287-2-8", "zh": "从手中放出的，如标枪等；由器械放出的，如箭等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1289-2-9", "zh": "弓：issāsa、dhanu、kodaṇḍa、cāpa（非阴性）、sarāsana；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1290-2-7", "zh": "弓弦：guṇa、jiyā、jyā；另外，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1291-2-6", "zh": "箭：sara、patti、sāyaka、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1293-2-18", "zh": "vāṇa、kaṇḍa、usu（通两性）、khurappa、tejana、asana；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1294-2-9", "zh": "箭筒：tūṇī（阴性）、kalāpa、tūṇa、tūṇīra、vāṇadhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1296-2-11", "zh": "箭羽：pakkha、vāja；涂了毒的箭称为 diddha；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1297-2-10", "zh": "箭靶：lakkha、vejjha、sarabya；练习射箭称为 upāsana。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1299-2-10", "zh": "剑：maṇḍalagga、nettiṃsa、asi、khagga、sāyaka；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1300-2-9", "zh": "剑鞘称为 kosī（阴性）；剑等的柄称为 tharu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1302-2-9", "zh": "盾牌：kheṭaka、phalaka、camma；短剑：illī、karapālikā；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1303-2-11", "zh": "匕首：churikā、satthī、asiputtī；棍棒：laguḷa、muggara。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1305-2-10", "zh": "尖刺：salla（非阴性）、saṅku（阳性）；锛子：vāsī、tacchanī（阴性）；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1306-2-14", "zh": "斧头：kuṭhārī（阴性）、pharasu（阳性）；凿石的工具称为 ṭaṅka。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1308-2-10", "zh": "kaṇaya（短矛）、bhindivāḷa（投枪）、cakka（飞轮）、kunta（长矛）、gadā（锤矛），", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1309-2-7", "zh": "以及 satti（标枪）等，都是兵器的种类。另外，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1310-2-7", "zh": "尖端、棱角：koṇa、assa、koṭi（阴性）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1312-2-9", "zh": "出行、行进：niyyāna、gamana、yātrā、paṭṭhāna、gama、gati；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1313-2-13", "zh": "尘土：cuṇṇa、paṃsu、raja、dhūlī（阴性）、reṇu（通两性）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1315-2-10", "zh": "颂唱世系的歌者称为 māgadha、madhuka；颂赞者：vandī、thutipāṭhaka；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1316-2-4", "zh": "以歌声唤醒君王的人：vetāḷika、bodhakara；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1317-2-6", "zh": "摇铃报时的人：cakkika、ghaṇṭika。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1319-2-10", "zh": "旗帜：ketu、dhaja、paṭākā、kadalī、ketana；另外，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1320-2-12", "zh": "彼此争相说“我来、我来”的那种好胜心，称为 ahamahamikā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1322-2-9", "zh": "力量：bala、thāma、saha、satti；极其勇猛称为 vikkama；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1323-2-11", "zh": "在战场上得胜的人所饮的酒，称为 jayapāna（庆功酒）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1325-2-9", "zh": "战争：saṅgāma、sampahāra，以及 samara、raṇa（非阴性）、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1326-2-8", "zh": "āji（阴性）、āhava、yuddha、āyodhana、saṃyuga。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1328-2-10", "zh": "争吵：bhaṇḍana、vivāda、viggaha、kalaha、medhaga；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1329-2-6", "zh": "昏厥：mucchā、moha。强行：pasayha、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1330-2-5", "zh": "balakkāra、haṭha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1332-2-16", "zh": "预示吉凶的自然异象，称为 uppāda（异读 uppāta，参见第1027偈）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1333-2-8", "zh": "灾祸：īti（阴性）、ajañña、upasagga、upaddava。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1335-2-16", "zh": "摔跤称为 nibbuddha（异读 niyuddha）；胜利：jaya、vijaya；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1336-2-8", "zh": "战败：parājaya、bhaṅga；逃跑：palāyana、apakkama。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1338-2-8", "zh": "杀害：māraṇa、hanana、ghāta、nāsana、nisūdana、", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1339-2-9", "zh": "hiṃsana、saraṇa、hiṃsā、vadha、sasana、ghātana。", "confidence": 80}
